        <org.eventb.core.prPred name="p312" org.eventb.core.predicate="a∈dom(depTime{aircraft ↦ current_time})∧a∈dom(brandof)∧(depTime{aircraft ↦ current_time})(a)=(lastDepTime{runway ↦ current_time})((depRwy{aircraft ↦ runway})(a))⇒brandof(a)=(lastDepBrand{runway ↦ brandof(aircraft)})((depRwy{aircraft ↦ runway})(a))">
